SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS\, HALLOWEEN YOGA FLOW\, Lake Crabtr
 ee Community Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nLET'S CELEBRATE HALLOWEEN WITH A HALLO
 WEEN PLAYLIST AND SOME HALLOWEEN INSPIRED ASANAS. MAY EVEN TRY 'FLOATING G
 HOST'. COME AS YOU ARE\, OR FEEL FREE TO WEAR A COSTUME THAT YOU CAN MOVE 
 IN OR A BIT OF BLACK\, ORANGE AND WHITE:) ALL Levels Vinyasa Flow Yoga\; $
 15/person\n**ARRIVE EARLY IN ORDER TO GET PARKING.**\n\nCome enjoy nature\
 , as we do an ALL LEVELS vinyasa flow yoga practice\, at this beautiful lo
 cation. We will begin in a seated meditation\, flow\, then end in savasana
 . Modifications provided. Beginners welcome.\n\nBRING YOUR OWN YOGA MAT\, 
 towel\, water bottle\, plastic liner (if grass is wet). We will meet in th
 e open field area near the parking lot. Accepting Venmo @Darlene-Genander 
 or PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com\n\nLake Crabtree County Park\, past t
 he entrance booth\, at the open field\, near volleyball courts and Old Bee
 ch Nature Trail... first right after you enter the park.(If you get to the
  entrance where there are boat rentals and launch area you've gone too far
 ).\nLake Crabtree County Park\, 1400 Aviation Parkway\, Morrisville
