SUMMARY:"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Fall) Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**ONLY 2 SPOTS REMAIN!!!**\n*What woul
 d happen if you let go of some of the stuff you are holding internally?*\n
 We will come together again for another **"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness
  (Fall) Retreat with the theme '*The Art of Letting Go'*.** This is beginn
 er friendly (including first time students). As we immerse ourselves in th
 e fall season\, we learn from nature that it is okay to let go in order to
  get ready for the next season (in life). This day\, set with intention\, 
 will offer you the opportunity to release what no longer serves you.\n\n* 
 Vinyasa flow yoga to yin practice (outdoors\, weather permitting with opti
 on for indoor practice)\n* Breathing and releasing\n* Nature connection an
 d immersion using all of our senses\n* Creative time\n* Use of fire pit fo
 r releasing ceremony\n* Hot teas and snacks\n* Nourishing lunch\n* Gift ba
 g for your healing journey\n\nSettle in. Open up your heart and let the da
 y feed your soul.\nBring your yoga mat and wear layers. We will move from 
 the indoors/outdoors throughout the day. Arrival at 9:45am and programming
  will be from 10am - 2pm with option to stay and settle in a bit longer (u
 ntil 3pm) on the porch\, around the pond or inside the cabin in the cozy s
 pace.\n**Your payment of $130 is due when you sign up and holds your spot/
  is your ticket to the event.** Please pay by Venmo\n@Darlene-Genander (08
 62 if asked)\, by PayPal dgenander@yogainnature or accepting Zelle
