SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nALL LEVELS WELCOME. Join us for a viny
 asa flow (beginner friendly with options to level up) to yin practice endi
 ng in savasana. Join our community and meet other like-minded people! Yoga
  heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow to yin y
 oga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in 
 grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups tha
 t use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE T
 HE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET. We practice in the grass Ellipse a
 rea:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@
 yogainnature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with us. Meet others and make friends
  in our yoga community.\nBring a mat\; water\; and anything else you may n
 eed for your outdoor yoga practice. You may also want an old towel or plas
 tic liner for under your mat\, if the grass is damp. Wear layers.\nALL LEV
 ELS WELCOME.
